   MIT License — see the standard MIT terms reproduced at the end of this file.


4) Administrative divisions of China (MIT)
   `web/js/china-regions.json` (settings page city picker data) is generated
   from the `modood/Administrative-divisions-of-China` dataset
   (https://github.com/modood/Administrative-divisions-of-China), dist/pca.json.
   Only administrative region names are kept; Hong Kong / Macau / Taiwan
   entries are added manually at city level.

