   MIT License — see the standard MIT terms reproduced at the end of this file.


This project's own contributions
--------------------------------

Original work in this repository focuses on the `ai_brain` main loop and
on integrating / modifying the chat shell and memory pipeline for a
self-hosted single-user companion. Do not describe the shell or memory
pipeline as invented from scratch; credit the upstream projects above.


